# Build context exclusions. Docker matches a pattern only at the context root
# unless it carries a leading `**/`; the nested forms below are what keep
# web/node_modules, web/.next, api/.venv, etc. out of the context.
**/.git
**/.next
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/data
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/*.db
**/.venv
